@title Castlevania - Circle of the Moon (USA)
@file Castlevania - Circle of the Moon (U) [!].gba
@game AAME
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: the first save room is further into the Catacombs (past the bone-throwing skeletons, down the plank shaft and along to the Dash Boots area); the skeletons' bone throws run on different frames in each emulator, so the first hit lands differently and the three runs drift apart
# DATA SELECT > empty file > name AA > opening dialog (A taps) > Nathan lands
# in the Catacombs; walk to the left wall, then right and down the shaft of
# wooden planks past the skeletons to the bottom ledge.
# Findings from the authoring sessions (lockstep, same inputs):
# - nba: Nathan's landing pose/camera differs at f6698 and f7078; by f8110
#   nba's Nathan is in another part of the shaft (knocked elsewhere).
# - dingbat-bios vs mgba: identical to f7158; at f7178 the lower-left
#   skeleton's throw pose differs (dingbat-bios is the odd one, mgba = nba),
#   at f7188 mgba is the odd one (dingbat-bios = nba); bones in flight sit at
#   different places at f7790 in all three. After the hit at ~f8058 the
#   knockback differs and by f8178 dingbat-bios and mgba show different
#   camera positions.

[new]
wait 600
press START
# until text Game timeout=600 every=10
wait 164
wait 60
checkpoint main_menu window=30 compare=text
press A
# until text Choose timeout=300 every=10
wait 34
wait 30
checkpoint data_select window=10
press A
# until text ENTRY timeout=300 every=10
wait 34
wait 30
checkpoint name_entry window=10
press A after=20
press A after=20
press START after=30
checkpoint name_aa window=10
press A
# until text 1830 timeout=900 every=10
wait 414
checkpoint intro_scroll window=30 compare=text
# mash A until text sealed timeout=6000 every=20
tap A times=159 every=20 hold=4
checkpoint dracula window=30 compare=text
tap A times=90 every=20 hold=4
wait 30
checkpoint catacombs window=0
press LEFT hold=150
press RIGHT hold=200
wait 60
press LEFT hold=20
press LEFT hold=20
wait 10
press LEFT hold=40
tap B times=6 every=15 hold=4
checkpoint plank_shaft window=0
tap B times=3 every=15 hold=4
hold LEFT
press A hold=20 after=10
release
tap B times=5 every=15 hold=4
press LEFT hold=60
wait 60
press SELECT
wait 40
checkpoint map window=0 compare=text
press SELECT
wait 30
press RIGHT hold=60
tap B times=4 every=15 hold=4
hold RIGHT
tap B times=10 every=20 hold=4
release
checkpoint shaft_bottom window=0
